cyprus_north_census: the census taken in the north of Cyprus on 4 December 2011
  250 quarters, 32 municipalities, 12 sub-districts, 5 districts; 286,257 residents
  medians from single years: north 31.2; Gazimağusa 30.3, Girne 32.0, Güzelyurt 32.5, İskele 33.3, Lefkoşa 30.5
  Kyrenia: 31 of its 46 polygons bound, holding 51,980 of the 69,163 residents the census counts in it (75.2%); not bound: Agios Amvrosios Keryneias, Agirda, Belapais, Ftericha, Karmi, Kato Dikomo, Kazafani, Motides, Myrtou, Palaiosofos, Panagra, Pano Dikomo, Templos, Thermeia, Trapeza
  (the census's Girne district: median 32.0, 113.2 men per 100 women)
  152 polygons carry 194 quarters, 196,712 residents of 286,257; 2 of 2 the Republic lists empty written; 38 northern polygons say why they have no figure, and 5 in the buffer zone; 54 quarters on no polygon (87,660 residents)
